{
  "manifest_version": 2,
  "id": "github.cateye.scp-article",
  "version": "0.3.3",
  "name": "SCP 条目查询",
  "description": "【非商业插件：SCP 基金会各分部维基的文本内容与官方页头素材依 CC BY-SA 3.0 授权（署名与修改说明见仓库 NOTICE.md），插件仅做只读抓取与即时展示，不缓存不转载正文；插件代码按 MIT 提供】按编号或关键字查询 SCP 基金会条目：/scp 查询国际站，/scp cn 查询中文分部。文章默认渲染为图片发送（内嵌对应分部官方页头 logo 与横幅底纹，抓取失败依次回退本机缓存与插件内置兜底资源，经宿主 render.html2png 渲染、send.image 发送，失败自动回退文本合并转发）；本地维护条目目录（编号+标题）实现关键字搜索与随机抽选，长文自动分页。仅提供 /scp 指令，不注册给 LLM 调用的工具。",
  "author": {
    "name": "cateye",
    "url": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "urls": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki/cateye_scp_article",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki/cateye_scp_article",
    "documentation": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki/cateye_scp_article/blob/main/README.md",
    "issues": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki/cateye_scp_article/issues"
  },
  "host_application": {
    "min_version": "1.0.0",
    "max_version": "1.99.99"
  },
  "sdk": {
    "min_version": "2.5.0",
    "max_version": "2.99.99"
  },
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "type": "python_package",
      "name": "httpx",
      "version_spec": ">=0.25.0"
    }
  ],
  "capabilities": [
    "send.text",
    "send.forward",
    "send.image",
    "render.html2png",
    "config.get"
  ],
  "i18n": {
    "default_locale": "zh-CN",
    "supported_locales": [
      "zh-CN"
    ]
  },
  "plugin_type": "data",
  "display": {
    "icon": {
      "type": "lucide",
      "value": "file-search",
      "fallback": "package"
    }
  },
  "changelog": "CHANGELOG.md"
}